sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Client
    participant C as BookingController
    participant O as BookingSagaOrchestrator
    participant Se as SeatService
    participant P as PaymentService (simulated gateway)
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Ob as outbox_events

    U->>C: POST /api/bookings  (Idempotency-Key)
    C->>O: execute()
    rect rgb(235,245,255)
    Note over O,DB: STEP 1 - transaction 1
    O->>DB: INSERT booking PENDING + saga(BOOKING_CREATED)
    O->>Ob: BookingCreated
    end
    rect rgb(235,245,255)
    Note over O,DB: STEP 2 - transaction 2
    O->>Se: lock(seat)
    Se->>DB: AVAILABLE -> TEMPORARILY_LOCKED (atomic)
    O->>DB: saga(SEAT_LOCKED)
    O->>Ob: SeatLocked
    end
    Note over O,P: STEP 3 - payment, idempotent
    O->>P: processPayment(key = pay-<key>)
    P->>DB: INSERT payment PENDING (unique key)
    P->>P: gateway.charge() - outside any DB transaction
    P->>DB: PENDING -> COMPLETED
    P->>Ob: PaymentCompleted
    rect rgb(235,255,235)
    Note over O,DB: STEP 4 - transaction 4
    O->>Se: confirm(seat) - only if lock still valid and ours
    Se->>DB: TEMPORARILY_LOCKED -> BOOKED
    O->>DB: booking CONFIRMED, saga COMPLETED, notification
    O->>Ob: BookingConfirmed
    end
    O-->>C: BookingResult
    C-->>U: 201 CONFIRMED
